Subject: [PATCH] USB: serial: ftdi_sio: fix misspelling of
 "STMicroelectronics"

"STMicroelectronics" company name is misspelled. Fix it.

Change-Id: I03fffc56d15170f1ea9501d374a882fe43b6dff1
Signed-off-by: Amelie Delaunay <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/569544
Reviewed-by: Fabrice GASNIER <fabrice.gasnier@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Fabrice GASNIER <fabrice.gasnier@foss.st.com>
---
 drivers/usb/serial/ftdi_sio_ids.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/usb/serial/ftdi_sio_ids.h
+++ b/drivers/usb/serial/ftdi_sio_ids.h
@@ -1373,7 +1373,7 @@
 #define WHT_PID			0x0004 /* Wireless Handheld Terminal */
 
 /*
- * STMicroelectonics
+ * STMicroelectronics
  */
 #define ST_VID			0x0483
 #define ST_STMCLT_2232_PID	0x3746
